.playwright-mcp/
logs/
errors.log

# Dashboard anchor-comment stores for living docs/logs (preserve-commit-status:
# doc/log comments stay local, never committed). The docs categorization now
# surfaces docs/mentor_updates/*.md and docs/ideas/*.md as commentable, so their
# .comments/ stores need covering too — a broad glob catches every doc subtree.
**/.comments/

# Per-run completion sentinels (#598) — the SLURM finalize rsync lands them
# inside the working tree under eval_results/issue_<N>/slurm-<jobid>/; they
# are runtime noise, never committed (the git artifact check needs >=1
# TRACKED file under eval_results/issue_<N>/ — the eval JSONs — not this).
.completion-sentinel.json

# Embedded git repo (Overleaf paper) — tracked in its own remote
overleaf_paper/
.vercel
